From 857944b367218e9f287206a6888b742a9a92e391 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Just-Intent <346791974+Just-Intent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:23:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Optional expanded main heap (expanded_game_heap=1)

With extended_graphics_memory the retail texture pool leaves the lower
64 MiB; give 16 MiB of that room to the game's main heap (0x1806A0) and
16,384 block descriptors instead of 7,000. Large maps no longer hang in
the retail allocator's retry loop when the heap runs out while streaming.
Ignored without the graphics bank. Not yet tested in game.
